     "time": "Session 1",
     "title": "Road to CTO & CHIP",
     "desc": "Access, guiding, wire strategy – the essentials that get you to the lesion and through it."
    },
    {
     "time": "Session 2",
     "title": "CTO & CHIP update 2026",
     "desc": "What changed this year – techniques, devices and the data behind them."
    },
    {
     "time": "Session 3",
     "title": "MCS-supported PCI",
